    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about \"cracks\" though. some things are just shattered. like, if a glass breaks into a million pieces, you can't just glue it back and expect it to hold water again. i feel like i've been shattered for so long that there isn't even a shape left to fix. it's just... it's exhausting to keep trying to hold it together when there's nothing left to hold.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
